# GitHub epic delivery loop

At session start (and when the user asks to continue roadmap work), follow the **vazivo-gh-delivery** skill.

## Mandatory path

1. **Sync board** — `gh` issues/epics + [Vazivo Capability Roadmap](https://github.com/users/merouaneamqor/projects/6); do not invent parallel todos outside GitHub.
2. **Pick Ready** — only `Ready` / assigned P0 (or user-named) child issues; one issue = one branch = one agent.
3. **Trace** — comment on the issue → set Project status `In progress` → implement on `feature/<n>-slug` (worktree if parallel) → tests via Docker Compose → `gh pr create` linking `#n`.
4. **Close the loop** — wait for CI green → rebase/resolve if dirty → squash-merge → close issue → Project `Done`.
5. **Never stop at “PR opened”** when the user wants delivery through merge unless they say review-only.

## Hard product constraints (still apply)

- Tenant scope; `morocco_ops` for Morocco surfaces; FR/EN/ES/AR; no YOOBIC clone; no Darija; no WhatsApp intake; no force-push `main`.
